{"id":"16D","title":"Buying and Selling","part":{"n":16,"title":"Economic and monetary laws"},"url":"/law/16-economic-and-monetary-laws/16d","entries":[{"id":"16D.1","text":"You are not to deal dishonestly or falsely with others when you buy and sell.","refs":[{"book":"Leviticus","chapter":19,"verses":"11"},{"book":"2 Kings","chapter":22,"verses":"7"},{"book":"Acts","chapter":5,"verses":"1-6"}],"citation":"Lev. 19:11; 2 Kings 22:7; Acts 5:1-6."},{"id":"16D.2","text":"When you sell to your neighbor or buy from your neighbor, you shall not oppress one another.","refs":[{"book":"Leviticus","chapter":25,"verses":"14-17"}],"citation":"Lev. 25:14-17."},{"id":"16D.3","text":"You shall not be unrighteous or have unjust gain in trading, selling or buying.","refs":[{"book":"Proverbs","chapter":28,"verses":"8"},{"book":"Isaiah","chapter":33,"verses":"15"},{"book":"Ezekiel","chapter":28,"verses":"4-8,18"}],"citation":"Prov. 28:8; Isa. 33:15; Ezek. 28:4-8, 18."},{"id":"16D.4","text":"Free enterprise is recognized in trading and selling of all kinds of wares.","refs":[{"book":"Genesis","chapter":42,"verses":"34"},{"book":"Nehemiah","chapter":13,"verses":"20"},{"book":"Proverbs","chapter":31,"verses":"24"},{"book":"Isaiah","chapter":23,"verses":"8"},{"book":"Ezekiel","chapter":27,"verses":"12-24"},{"book":"Matthew","chapter":25,"verses":"9,16"},{"book":"Luke","chapter":22,"verses":"36"}],"citation":"Gen. 42:34; Neh. 13:20; Prov. 31:24; Isa. 23:8; Ezek. 27:12-24; Matt. 25:9, 16; Luke 22:36."},{"id":"16D.5","text":"Better is a little with righteousness, than vast revenues without justice.","refs":[{"book":"Proverbs","chapter":16,"verses":"8"}],"citation":"Prov. 16:8."},{"id":"16D.6","text":"Ill-gotten gains do not profit.","refs":[{"book":"Proverbs","chapter":10,"verses":"2"}],"citation":"Prov. 10:2."},{"id":"16D.7","text":"Sale of goods.","refs":[{"book":"Genesis","chapter":41,"verses":"57"},{"book":"Deuteronomy","chapter":2,"verses":"6"},{"book":"Proverbs","chapter":31,"verses":"24"},{"book":"James","chapter":4,"verses":"13"}],"citation":"Gen. 41:57; Deut 2:6; Prov. 31:24; Ja. 4:13."}]}